// Funnel Intelligence & Customer Journey Platform — Industrial Architecture
// Paste into Eraser: New file → Diagram as Code → Architecture Diagram.

direction right
colorMode bold
styleMode shadow
typeface clean

SourceSystems [color: blue] {
  MarketingPlatforms [label: "Marketing platforms\nAds · campaigns · web analytics"]
  CRM [label: "CRM / lead management\nLeads · qualification · opportunities"]
  DealerDMS [label: "Dealer & sales systems\nOffers · orders · vehicle sales"]
  CustomerCare [label: "Customer-care systems\nCases · channels · CSAT"]
  DigitalEvents [label: "Website & app events\nClickstream · configurator · consent"]
  MasterData [label: "Customer / product MDM\nIdentity · region · vehicle catalog"]
}

IntegrationAndSecurity [color: purple] {
  APIGateway [label: "API gateway\nOAuth2 · rate limits · audit"]
  EventStreaming [label: "Event streaming\nEvent Hubs / Kafka"]
  BatchIngestion [label: "Batch ingestion\nData Factory / connectors"]
  SecureTransfer [label: "Secure file exchange\nSFTP · dealer extracts"]
  Secrets [label: "Key Vault\nSecrets · certificates · keys"]
  Identity [label: "Entra ID\nSSO · managed identities"]
}

DataPlatform [color: teal] {
  Landing [label: "Bronze / landing zone\nImmutable source events\nEncrypted data lake"]
  SchemaRegistry [label: "Data contracts & schema registry\nVersioning · compatibility"]
  Orchestrator [label: "Orchestration\nSchedules · retries · dependencies"]
  QualityEngine [label: "Data-quality engine\nCompleteness · validity · duplicates\nFunnel-sequence checks"]
  IdentityResolution [label: "Customer identity resolution\nCRM ID · email hash · vehicle ID\nGolden Customer ID"]
  Transformation [label: "Spark / SQL transformations\nStandardisation · attribution\nJourney sessionisation"]
  Quarantine [label: "Quarantine zone\nInvalid / unresolved records"]
  CuratedLakehouse [label: "Silver / curated lakehouse\nConformed customer journey"]
  Warehouse [label: "Gold warehouse\nStar schema · aggregates\nHistorical snapshots"]
  FeatureStore [label: "Feature store\nLead score · churn · next best action"]
}

GovernanceAndPrivacy [color: orange] {
  Catalog [label: "Data catalog & lineage\nOwnership · glossary · lineage"]
  Privacy [label: "Privacy controls\nConsent · pseudonymisation\nRetention · GDPR DSAR"]
  AccessPolicy [label: "Access policy\nRBAC / ABAC · row-level access"]
  AuditLogs [label: "Audit logs\nAccess · transformations · exports"]
}

AnalyticsAndServing [color: green] {
  SemanticModel [label: "Power BI semantic model\nCertified KPIs · DAX · RLS"]
  ExecutiveBI [label: "Executive BI\nConversion · revenue · retention"]
  FunctionalBI [label: "Marketing · Sales · Care dashboards\nDrill-through / self-service"]
  StreamlitApp [label: "Operational Streamlit app\nReal-time investigation\nFiltered data export"]
  MLScoring [label: "Model serving\nLead propensity · churn risk\nNext-best action"]
  Alerting [label: "Alerts & workflows\nTeams · email · CRM tasks"]
  CRMActivation [label: "CRM / campaign activation\nAssigned lead action\nAudience suppression"]
}

Operations [color: red] {
  CICD [label: "CI/CD & IaC\nGitHub Actions · Terraform\nDev / Test / Prod"]
  Monitoring [label: "Observability\nFreshness · volume · SLA\nCost · pipeline failures"]
  ModelMonitoring [label: "ML monitoring\nDrift · bias · performance"]
  IncidentManagement [label: "Incident management\nJira / ServiceNow\nData issue workflow"]
}

// Ingestion pathways
MarketingPlatforms > BatchIngestion: Daily API extracts
CRM > BatchIngestion: Incremental CDC
DealerDMS > SecureTransfer: Daily dealer files
CustomerCare > BatchIngestion: Incremental case extracts
DigitalEvents > EventStreaming: Real-time events
MasterData > BatchIngestion: Master-data refresh

BatchIngestion > Landing: Batch raw data
SecureTransfer > Landing: Validated files
EventStreaming > Landing: Streaming raw events
APIGateway > EventStreaming: Secure APIs
Secrets --> APIGateway: Credentials
Identity --> APIGateway, BatchIngestion, Orchestrator: Managed access

// Processing, quality, and governance
Landing > SchemaRegistry: Validate contract
SchemaRegistry > QualityEngine: Accepted schema
Landing > QualityEngine: Profile raw data
QualityEngine > Quarantine: Failed records
QualityEngine > IdentityResolution: Valid records
MasterData > IdentityResolution: Match reference data
IdentityResolution > Transformation: Golden Customer ID
Transformation > CuratedLakehouse: Conformed events
Transformation > Warehouse: Fact / dimension tables
Transformation > FeatureStore: Features
Orchestrator > BatchIngestion, QualityEngine, Transformation: Run and retry

Catalog <> Landing, CuratedLakehouse, Warehouse, SemanticModel: Lineage and glossary
Privacy <> IdentityResolution, CuratedLakehouse, Warehouse: Minimise and protect PII
AccessPolicy > Warehouse, SemanticModel, StreamlitApp: Enforce user access
AccessPolicy --> AuditLogs: Access decisions

// Reporting, action, and feedback loop
Warehouse > SemanticModel: Certified datasets
SemanticModel > ExecutiveBI, FunctionalBI: Governed metrics
Warehouse > StreamlitApp: Read-only analytical queries
FeatureStore > MLScoring: Online / batch features
MLScoring > CRMActivation: Scores and recommendations
FunctionalBI > Alerting: KPI threshold breached
MLScoring > Alerting: High-risk customer / lead
Alerting > CRMActivation: Create task or campaign audience
CRMActivation --> CRM: Sales / marketing action

// Platform operations
CICD > Orchestrator, Transformation, SemanticModel, StreamlitApp: Versioned deployment
Monitoring <-- Orchestrator, QualityEngine, Warehouse, SemanticModel, StreamlitApp: Health and SLA telemetry
ModelMonitoring <-- MLScoring: Model telemetry
Monitoring > IncidentManagement: Pipeline / freshness alert
QualityEngine > IncidentManagement: Data-quality issue

legend [position: bottom] {
  [connection: >, color: teal, label: "Primary data flow"]
  [connection: -->, color: orange, label: "Security, control, or asynchronous flow"]
  [connection: <>, color: purple, label: "Governance relationship"]
  [color: red, label: "Operational resilience"]
}
